<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="ECG deterministic figure generator" type="device" compressed="false">
  <diagram id="reuse-plan-flowthrough-f05-flowthrough-outcomes" name="FlowThrough changes LLC allocation, not lookup or service" ecgTitle="FlowThrough changes LLC allocation, not lookup or service" ecgDescription="A FlowThrough record request uses normal translation, private caches, LLC tag lookup, miss service, and response. An LLC hit remains a hit. For an LLC miss, an all-no-allocate MSHR skips the LLC fill while mixed targets retain allocation because gem5 combines allocOnFill with OR.">
